                <pb facs="0246" n="166" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg166"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-03"><hi rendition="#italic">May 3,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports serious disturbances in southern portion of the province of
                    Chihli; that the first troops sent were overpowered, and a larger force is being
                    sent by the viceroy.)</p>
            </div>
